sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as Super Admin
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant BE as FastAPI Backend
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    Admin->>FE: Enter Username & Password
    FE->>BE: POST /api/auth/login (form-data)
    BE->>DB: Query Admin by Username
    DB-->>BE: Admin Record & Hashed Password
    BE->>BE: Verify Password (Bcrypt)
    
    alt Credentials Valid
        BE->>BE: Create JWT (sub: username, role: admin)
        BE-->>FE: 200 OK (access_token)
        FE->>FE: Store token & role in LocalStorage
        FE-->>Admin: Redirect to Admin Dashboard
    else Credentials Invalid
        BE-->>FE: 401 Unauthorized
        FE-->>Admin: Show Error Message
    end
